// Azure Speech throttling, hourly (DIAAT-282). Recording pipeline (Phase 2): Speech.
//
// Measure: batch calls Azure Speech refused with HTTP 429, the approaching-limit signal.
// Formula: sum(value) of transcription.speech.throttled per hour, by speech.operation.
// Source: counter transcription.speech.throttled, emitted only by the recording batch
//   client, so no area filter: metric dimensions do not carry hmcts.area (decision 1).
//   Never sampled (OD2). The Retry-After Azure sent is on the job.retried and
//   job.poll_failed events (speech.retry_after_s).
// Caveats: no rows means no throttling, not missing data.
customMetrics
| where name == "transcription.speech.throttled"
| summarize throttled = sum(value) by bin(timestamp, 1h), operation = tostring(customDimensions["speech.operation"])
| order by timestamp asc
